1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,280
Woman: What do you know about this rock festival that's happening?

2
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:09,070
Man: Not much. Do you know what time it starts?

3
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:11,240
Woman: It kicks off at 3:00 PM.

4
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:15,220
Man: That's perfect. Oh, I remember hearing that. There will be food trucks.

5
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:18,080
Woman: Oh, right. And a dance floor.

6
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:20,940
Man: No way. You can't keep us away

7
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:24,020
Let's get there early so we can get a good spot.
